<title>HONG KONG: HK govt to auction two plots of land on Mar 25.</title>
<headline>HK govt to auction two plots of land on Mar 25.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong government will auction two pieces of crown land for residential development on March 25, government land agent Francis Ng said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sites are a 2,100 sq-metre plot in Chung Hau Street in the Ho Man Tin district and a 26,500 sq-metre plot in Siu Sai Wan district, he told reporters after a land auction.</p>
<p>A Yuen Long site originally scheduled to go under the hammer in the same auction had been withdrawn due to problems in site planning, he said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
